  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "is an exciting arcade game where you take on the role of a tiger climbing
    steep cliffs! Tap on ledges to help the tiger jump upwards, but be careful: some
    ledges will crack and break 2 seconds after landing. If the tiger stays on a
    cracked ledge for too long, it will fall and lose the game.\r  \nWatch out for
    falling sharp rocks along the way \u2014 they deal 1 point of damage. The tiger
    has only 3 hearts, and losing all of them means game over. Collect coins, but
    stay alert: some coins are helpful, restoring hearts, while others are dangerous.
    Most coins are currency that you can use to customize your tiger in the shop.
    While the selection of skins is currently limited, more will be added in future
    updates.\r                         \nSome ledges move randomly along the X-axis,
    adding unpredictability to your climb. Keep an eye on the tiger\u2019s stamina
    \u2014 it recovers while resting on ledges, but every jump and hit reduces it.
    If your stamina runs out, the tiger will be unable to continue.\r            
    \nYour main goal is to reach the finish line, which gets farther with each level.
    Help the tiger overcome obstacles, collect valuable coins, and reach the top!                                           "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e914ab7a90f587343be9fbb2f1da54a8, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 5295522336016132428, guid: e914ab7a90f587343be9fbb2f1da54a8, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
